        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >iRboth&quot; is a command battle RPG in which players collect memory fragments, explore a transformed world, and fight while learning enemy behavior patterns. The player becomes one of the &quot;Autoloids,&quot; robots equipped with AI, and explores tiled stages to clear them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This title is intentionally designed with a high level of difficulty. Will you be able to overcome the difficulties?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple yet profound battle system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875240/extras/e0fd9eda711a1b5b221e437c9191a216.avif?t=1764512018\" width=576 height=324 /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fight by selecting commands called &quot;modules&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike most command battle RPGs, you select two at a time. In addition, you move, push and pull the enemy, and give them attacks with a defined range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determine the distance and use the most appropriate action to defeat powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There are a thousand ways to fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875240/extras/b421c0cae3af5f682eceabcc50508a3f.avif?t=1764512018\" width=576 height=324 /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a wide variety of modules that can be obtained by exploring and defeating enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They vary in attack, defense, movement and their performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A story that doesn't tell much</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875240/extras/4aa4fe75d7977e3fa991ed9148a88d77.avif?t=1764512018\" width=576 height=324 /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By collecting &quot;memory&quot; fragments, which can be obtained as you progress through the game, you can get a glimpse into the background of the story and the emotions of the characters.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >iRboth&quot; is a command battle RPG in which players collect memory fragments, explore a transformed world, and fight while learning enemy behavior patterns. The player becomes one of the &quot;Autoloids,&quot; robots equipped with AI, and explores tiled stages to clear them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*This title is intentionally designed with a high level of difficulty. Will you be able to overcome the difficulties?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple yet profound battle system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875240/extras/e0fd9eda711a1b5b221e437c9191a216.avif?t=1764512018\" width=576 height=324 /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You fight by selecting commands called &quot;modules&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike most command battle RPGs, you select two at a time. In addition, you move, push and pull the enemy, and give them attacks with a defined range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determine the distance and use the most appropriate action to defeat powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There are a thousand ways to fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875240/extras/b421c0cae3af5f682eceabcc50508a3f.avif?t=1764512018\" width=576 height=324 /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a wide variety of modules that can be obtained by exploring and defeating enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They vary in attack, defense, movement and their performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A story that doesn't tell much</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875240/extras/4aa4fe75d7977e3fa991ed9148a88d77.avif?t=1764512018\" width=576 height=324 /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By collecting &quot;memory&quot; fragments, which can be obtained as you progress through the game, you can get a glimpse into the background of the story and the emotions of the characters.</p>",
